        "heading_f7R9pf": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Petromax Story",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_6kPLTg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Since 1910, Petromax has fueled a passion for adventure with our top-tier outdoor living, cooking, and lighting gear. From the legendary Dutch Oven to durable firepits and grills, their products are built for the brave. Crafted for resistance, durability, and versatility - because they're adventurers, just like you. </p><p>Berlin's MaxGraetz developed the renowned high-pressure lamp, giving birth to the Petromax brand. Named after Graetz's nickname, \"Petroleum Maxe,\" the brand has been dedicated to bringing independence to everyday life through innovative technology and a passion for fire. </p><p>Today, Petromax remains true to this vision, inspiring outdoor cooking and experiences. </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
